not just about this particular thing that I'm looking at, this feature we launched, but to think about any feature that you think might have some sort of impact on how people do a task in the workplace or even at home, how that actually changes some notion of productivity.

4
00:00:34,446 --> 00:00:48,240
And I think this is a very interesting area for us to think about as a community because the nature of work is changing, and what we think about as work and as productivity is also changing.

5
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:59,748
And so as we're thinking about that, we do have to think about what our values are, what do we value, what is the point of the work that we're doing, and what is the outcome that we actually want.

